    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to 5.15.1:
  * Fix DFlash candidate-token device mismatch when models are
    split with device_map=&quot;auto&quot;
  * Align CandidateGenerator sampling with the processed logit
    distribution
  * Fix MTP config when mlp_layer_types is absent
  * Fall back from Lanczos to bicubic image resampling on CUDA
  * Move Gemma 4 video features onto the model device
</comment>
    <requestid>1372113</requestid>
